## Story Description
The file data/input/sample.csv was generated with invoice numbers that do not match what tests/test_ingestion.py expects. Three tests fail: test_ingest_cn_row_is_credit_note looks for CN-2024-001 (does not exist in current CSV), test_ingest_intercompany_row_flagged looks for INV-2024-006 to be INTERCOMPANY (currently Creative Display), and test_ingest_usd_row_converted_to_aud looks for INV-2024-007 to be DHL USD 8750 (currently INTERCOMPANY AUD). Rewrite sample.csv with exactly 10 rows matching the test expectations. The header is: VENDOR_NAME,VENDOR_NUM,INV_NO,INV_DATE,LINE_DESC,AMT,CCY,GL_CODE,COST_CTR,PAY_TERMS,PO_NUM,BUS_UNIT,SITE

## Acceptance Criteria
- Edit file: data/input/sample.csv — rewrite with exactly 10 data rows plus header
- Include row: Sodexo Australia Pty Ltd,V-002,CN-2024-001,15/04/2024,Credit note - catering overcharge,-850.00,AUD,6512,CC-OPS-01,Net 30,,Operations,Melbourne
- Include row: INTERCOMPANY - LEGAL,V-999,INV-2024-006,12/02/2024,Legal services - internal,5000.00,AUD,7800100,CC-LEG-01,Net 45,,Corporate,Sydney
- Include row: DHL Express Pty Ltd,V-004,INV-2024-007,12/02/2024,International freight - Shanghai to Melb,8750.00,USD,6301,CC-LOG-01,Net 14,PO-9004,Operations,Sydney
- Include row: ,V-TAX,TAX-ADJ-001,31/03/2024,Tax adjustment - GST,-125.00,AUD,2100100,,N/A,,Corporate,Sydney (needed for test_ingest_tax_row_flagged)
- Include row: Officeworks Business Supplies,V-001,INV-2024-001,15/03/2024,Office supplies - toner cartridges HP,340.50,AUD,6421,CC-ADM-01,Net 30,PO-9001,Corporate,Sydney
- Total row count must be exactly 10 data rows
- Run: python3 -m pytest tests/test_ingestion.py::test_ingest_cn_row_is_credit_note tests/test_ingestion.py::test_ingest_intercompany_row_flagged tests/test_ingestion.py::test_ingest_usd_row_converted_to_aud tests/test_ingestion.py::test_ingest_sample_csv_returns_10_rows tests/test_ingestion.py::test_ingest_tax_row_flagged -v — all 5 must pass

