## Story Description
When a client creates a new engagement but has not uploaded any data, OverviewPage shows zeroed KPIs and blank charts, which is confusing. Add an empty-state banner: when !loadingOverview && !loadingMonths && (overview?.total_spend ?? 0) === 0 && monthData.length === 0, render a Card with UploadCloud icon, heading, subtext, and a button navigating to the upload page. Place it between the FilterBar and the KPI grid. The KPI grid and charts still render below (they show zeros, which is truthful). Import UploadCloud from lucide-react and useParams is already imported.

